WEBVTT

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:03.770
No good.

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:07.270
Waletta's spirit
is not responding to my calls.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:09.980
There's no doubt about it.

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:13.030
Some kind of spell
is interfering with the evocation.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:15.030
Which means...

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.820
something caused by humans.

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:18.030
Seems that way.

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.540
Then, according to the rules
of criminal investigations,

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:25.790
whoever gains the most by this death...

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:28.040
must be the one...

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.800
Wills Pelham Codrington.

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:33.670
Hold it! If our boy is the perp,

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:36.390
he didn't need to call a Lord
all the way out to the crime scene!

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:40.560
He could've done so to create a witness.

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:43.930
No. The true perpetrator is someone else.

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.190
There's no doubt about it.

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:21.820
In our world of Mages,

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:25.950
who the perpetrator is or the process
of how it was done hold no meaning.

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:29.870
You want to say you can
only deduce the why, right?

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:33.380
That's why we can assume
he's the only one with a motive.

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:35.050
Ms. Adashino,

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:38.340
what you call Wills' motive
is just speculation.

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:39.590
Yes.

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:44.140
Just like what you plea in defense,
Lord El-Melloi II.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:47.220
I've been entrusted with this case
by Spiritual Evocation.

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:50.900
I'll continue with the investigation
until the storm passes.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.350
All right.

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:54.230
I would definitely like to hear

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:57.860
the deductions of our great detective.

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:02.950
Unbelievable.
You're still going to continue?

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:05.740
You really live up to your rumors.

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:07.790
Rumors?

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:10.210
All sorts, yeah.

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:12.580
So, what are you gonna do now?

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:16.340
Our boy Wills is now confined by Adashino.

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:18.590
You thought of a countermove
already, right?

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:22.050
I need you to help me, Kairi Shishigou.

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:25.180
I need the assistance
of a Necromancer for this case.

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:27.260
I'd like advance payment.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:29.730
I don't have much on me.

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:31.230
Just gimme one of those.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:37.150
Thanks.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:38.440
So,

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:40.900
what is your end up to?

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:43.780
The execution of justice of course.

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:46.450
Policies does not deal with Magecraft,

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.160
but only with politics.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:50.910
Can't you give me a slightly better joke?

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.040
You like it, too, don't you?

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:57.290
Fun things like this...

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:02.010
I did say I'd help,

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:05.890
but I didn't think I'd have to help out
gathering reference materials.

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.430
I-I'm sorry.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:11.810
Is something wrong?

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:12.940
Yeah.

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:14.900
It just brought back some memories.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:18.820
You like things of this nature?

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:22.570
Not me. Someone in the family liked them.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:24.030
A child?

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:26.280
Yeah, I guess you could say that.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:30.330
In Britain, they say
that when children die,

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.370
their souls can't reach Heaven,
and they become fairies.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:39.550
But a Necromancer has nothing to do
with fairies or Heaven.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:42.670
That's enough storytelling.

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:43.920
Let's go back.

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:45.840
Oh, I'll take that!

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:47.220
It's fine.

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:50.220
I need the Lord to owe me a favor.

00:04:59.020 --> 00:04:59.900
That's right.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:02.900
I've never left my village before that,

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:06.660
so I'm surprised
at so many things in London.

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.910
It must be rough being an apprentice.

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:12.160
But Sir is very good to me.

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:18.500
That's a...

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:19.670
Black Dog.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:24.630
A Fairy or an evil spirit
that appears at crossroads.

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:28.050
Run! It's a bit too much
to bear for you, missie.

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:28.050
Add!

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:28.720
H-Hey!

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:30.890
<i>First restraint rescinded!</i>

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:37.520
You're amazing, missie.

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:40.520
That's a monster of a Mystic Code.

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:46.780
I didn't expect a Black Dog
to appear within the Workshop.

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:48.910
We're within a strict bounded field.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.200
There's no way it occurred naturally.

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:56.160
We can assume it was the true form of
the lightning that killed Waletta and the others.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.790
A Black Dog is also
an incarnation of thunder.

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:03.500
The danger this Workshop holds
is becoming more and more obvious.

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:07.630
There's something
I want to ask before that.

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:11.930
About missie's Mystic Code.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:13.640
What is that?

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:16.930
Do you need that information right now?

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:19.520
The Black Dog feared it.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:22.190
It could be the key
in figuring out the Dog's nature.

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:25.690
Gray?

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:32.070
That is King Arthur's spear.
Rhongomyniad.

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:34.490
A spear? That scythe is one?

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:36.540
The scythe is a disguise.

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:40.500
Add and the scythe are simply Codes
to seal away the spear.

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:43.750
Shut up! Respect me more!

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:48.010
A portrait of King Arthur
created by a certain family...

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:49.880
That is what she is.

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:52.680
Wait, wait, wait!

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:54.640
King Arthur is a guy, right?

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:58.180
No, a woman.
A girl of about Gray's age.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:04.110
I've met her as a Heroic Spirit
in the Holy Grail War. No doubt about it.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:06.030
Holy Grail War?

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:08.650
The Magecraft ritual...

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:12.410
where seven Heroic Spirits fight each other
for the omnipotent wish granter.

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:16.450
So, it's true that you were
part of that battle.

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:20.330
I simply witnessed it.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.340
I didn't fight at all.

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:27.960
But I see.

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:31.130
King Arthur, huh?
That would convince me.

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:36.640
Here in Britain, an army of spirits
appearing with wind and thunder...

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:40.140
is the Wild Hunt led by King Arthur.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:41.140
Indeed.

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:47.320
If spirits of the deceased who couldn't go
to Heaven or Hell are ghosts and fairies,

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:50.570
King Arthur is the king
of ghosts and Fairies.

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:55.450
King Arthur was defeated,
and left for Avalon.

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:59.950
That tale is based on a mythological
journey to the underworld.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.710
So, that's it!

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:06.960
I understand everything now.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:11.970
And now, I can prove my hypothesis!

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:14.970
Lord El-Melloi II's Case Files
｛Rail Zeppelin｝ Grace note

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:18.350
I'm commencing the ritual.

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:21.390
Wills, Shishigou, Reines...

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:22.890
Are you all ready?

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:24.020
I'm ready, but...

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:27.730
I don't think you can evoke those involved
even if you change locations.

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:29.320
I'm not evoking.

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:30.900
This is the spell.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:35.160
Elder Brother, I can't assist
with the ritual in my current condition.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:38.740
I just need you to stand there.
Trimmau, please support her.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:40.080
As you wish.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.000
We shall begin!

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:50.460
<i>We hereby light the guiding flame!</i>

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:55.300
<i>Thou from yonder, pass through
the white walls and see the guiding flame!</i>

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:57.640
<i>Thou art an iron hammer shattering deceit,</i>

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:59.560
<i>a ship crossing the blue seas,</i>

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:01.720
<i>a staircase to pass over the valleys!</i>

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:05.770
<i>I invite thee, child of celebration,
wild child of fertility!</i>

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:07.860
<i>O eternal flame,</i>

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:10.900
<i>dispel the mist and bring forth
a guest from yonder!</i>

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:36.050
You are...

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:38.300
Just as I thought.

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:46.850
To think you would actually use
Magecraft of this nature...

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:48.770
Huh? You can speak?

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:50.610
It's not difficult

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:55.650
if you make Wills' Fairy Eyes harmonize
with the element in Reines' Mystic Eyes.

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:57.490
Are you treating people like catalysts?

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:59.660
You're a catalyst!
I'm not simply treating you like one!

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:06.210
This Workshop was designed
to draw out the powers of Mystic Eyes...

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:08.920
to utilize Wills' Fairy Eyes.

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:11.880
My Fairy Eyes?

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:15.840
It uses Leylines to activate Mystic Eyes
to draw out their power.

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:21.430
And that magical energy uses the dead
as the cores to create artificial Fairies!

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:22.850
Isn't that so?

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.850
That is correct, son of man.

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:27.980
Just as I thought.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:30.440
What does that mean, sir?

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:33.020
So, the perpetrator was Sir Trevor,

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:36.400
and the weapon was the Workshop itself.

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:39.780
I had known that
since I entered this mansion.

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:43.280
So, the lightning strikes weren't accidents
but premeditative murders?

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:44.580
That's right!

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:49.000
This Workshop in itself
is a giant device for murder!

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:56.170
The Marburry Workshop calls down
the Black Dog and kills humans.

00:10:56.420 --> 00:11:00.260
The murders all took place on days
where the alignment of the Moon and stars

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:02.800
heightened powers
of the underworld and Earth.

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:04.350
Fifteen people in three years.

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:07.560
Those killed were transformed
by the Workshop

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:13.860
using the Fairies' powers and Fairy Eyes
into a new artificial Fairy, the Black Dog.

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:16.860
A dog that devours
the souls of the dead, huh?

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:22.950
This Workshop was for Sir Trevor
to control artificial Fairies to serve under him.

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:27.240
He must have not cared
about how many would die for that cause.

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:31.080
In other words, that Fairy there
and Wills' Fairy Eyes

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:33.580
are all like gears of this Workshop?

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:36.250
But why did Sir Trevor die?

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:40.090
It's not like he died
because he lost control of the place.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:41.510
I killed him.

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:42.800
You did?

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:47.930
That's right. That Mage deceived me
and disrupted our order.

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:49.930
Therefore, I punished him.

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:54.480
I see.

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:59.400
But that didn't stop the Workshop itself,
and that's why you sought for help.

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:01.860
I had known that girl would die.

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:04.110
Power can't be stopped once in motion.

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:06.830
I had known about it,
but I couldn't stop it.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:09.080
You are...

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:13.290
I didn't want to make you sad.

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:15.960
That's all.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:17.840
Oh, I see.

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:22.220
You didn't want to let go of the Workshop
because she was here.

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:23.470
Am I correct?

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:25.140
How did you...

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:27.300
Your disdain of women is famous.

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:30.470
Those who can see Fairies
are enchanted by Fairies.

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:32.350
That's what this is about, right?

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:34.690
That is a lovely, romantic relationship,

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:39.570
but can't you say that Wills' Fairy Eyes
killed Waletta, then?

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:41.820
He was merely being used!

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:46.280
Would you put the knife
used to commit a murder on trial?

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:51.540
The Leyline is moving strangely!

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:52.830
This is...

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:56.580
Run!

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:05.970
We managed to escape!

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:08.970
What the...

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:16.520
They're running out of control!

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:17.560
Oh, crap!

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:19.480
What do you mean, Lord?

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:23.190
I underestimated the effect
of the bounded field Adashino had put up!

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:27.490
As a result, it seems my ritual
has activated the Workshop!

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:30.370
Sorry. I should've noticed that.

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:33.200
No, this would've happened
sooner or later.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:34.960
The dead call for the dead,

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:38.420
and the Black Dog will transform
into the Wild Hunt! Look!

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:41.420
That's...

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:44.050
A gate to the world of Fairies!

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:49.220
Hey, it can't be that...

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:50.850
It's exactly that.

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:53.270
They're looking for more of their kind!

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:57.020
They'll add us to the queue of the dead.

00:13:57.520 --> 00:13:58.440
I see.

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:01.770
What are you going to do?

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:05.190
It seems I'm at least partially responsible.

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:13.160
I will hold it in for a while.
Please leave Ms. Reines to me.

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:16.000
Understood.

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:17.210
Let's go!

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:41.150
This is my father's...

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:04.960
Not bad, Mr. Elite from Spiritual Evocation!

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:05.960
Hey, Lord,

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:08.970
can I invoice expenditures
to the Clock Tower?

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:18.020
Send it to Policies!

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:19.350
Gotcha!

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:26.690
Dammit! How many people
has this killed?

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:29.110
Seeing how many
in the underground graveyard,

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:31.700
there must be quite a few deaths
that weren't reported.

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:33.820
You had a hunch, didn't you?

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:36.540
Well, yeah!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:54.010
We have no choice, Gray.

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:57.390
I solicit you.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.020
Understood.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:10.440
Hey, what's starting up?

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:12.400
We're going to use the Rhongomyniad.

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:13.240
Seriously?

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:14.530
Give us backup!

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:16.120
<i>Gray.</i>

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:17.700
<i>Rave.</i>

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:19.750
<i>Crave.</i>

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.000
<i>Deprave.</i>

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:31.550
I see, so, that...

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:32.930
...has been used.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:35.850
<i>Grave me.</i>

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:41.350
<i>Grave for you.</i>

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:49.440
Oh no!

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:52.150
They've realized
that she's our ace in the hole!

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:00.580
Don't worry!

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:02.910
Do what you will!

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:07.420
<i>Old Mystics.</i>

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:10.710
<i>Exterminate sweet mysteries.</i>

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:13.090
<i>All will return to the void.</i>

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:17.800
<i>Pseudo-Personality suspended.</i>

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:21.770
<i>Mana yield exceeds regulation.</i>

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:25.270
<i>Second stage restraint rescinded.</i>

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:28.230
<i>Sacred lance, removing restraints!</i>

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:35.820
The lance of King Arthur...

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:38.780
Surely, it can't exist in this era.

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:57.640
<i>Rhongomyniad!</i>

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:20.780
The gate is not gone?

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:22.200
It was too late!

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:25.120
Sir Trevor's spell was perfect!

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:27.870
It's not enough to just eradicate
the artificial Fairies!

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:31.090
We have no other choice.

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:32.590
What will you do?

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:35.710
I'll gouge Wills of his Mystic Eyes
and destroy the Workshop.

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:38.470
No, even that is useless.

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:43.310
Even if you did that, all that will happen
is that the sealed spirits will run wild!

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:48.690
But who knows how many months
it'd take to analyze and dismantle the spell?

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:51.020
There is a way.

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:56.780
A way to dismantle the spell.

00:18:58.820 --> 00:19:00.870
I should've done this
from the beginning.

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:03.280
I had my hunches all along, yet...

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:04.910
Wait, Wills!

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.040
If you do something like that...

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:11.420
I will not die.

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.130
I will go to the land...

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:16.670
where she, my father and Waletta
are waiting for me.

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:19.090
Stop it!

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:21.390
The dead will draw you in!

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:38.320
Wills!

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:42.950
Thank you, Lord El-Melloi II...

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:45.330
for dismantling the mystery around me.

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:47.450
Farewell.

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:54.880
Wills!

00:20:11.190 --> 00:20:13.650
Thank you for the hard work
in solving the case.

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:16.190
I would like to give you
a word of thanks.

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.230
I'll listen.

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:25.990
I found some amusing materials
while taking care of the aftermath.

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:31.540
What kind of secret
does Marburry Workshop still hold now?

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:34.170
The origin of Wills' Mystic Eyes.

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:36.170
Origin?

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:38.460
You are born with Mystic Eyes...

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:39.710
No way!

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:43.470
Yes. The "Mystic Eyes Collection Train."
You know of it, right?

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:44.640
Just in rumors.

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:48.680
Rail Zeppelin, the phantom train
that buys and sells Mystic Eyes.

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:50.350
It really existed?

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:52.180
It seems that Sir Trevor created Wills

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:56.110
to be the foundation for the Workshop
from the beginning.

00:20:57.230 --> 00:21:01.860
These are the materials concerning
Rail Zeppelin, though just a copy.

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:06.620
Can it be that Policies were here
all along to collect these materials?

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:09.120
Oh, what are you talking about?

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:13.750
You vixen! I shouldn't have dealt
with you after all!

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:19.840
One word of advice for you, missie.

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:22.550
Never take your eyes off of that Lord.

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:23.630
From Sir?

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:27.890
A guy captivated by the dead
is rather troublesome.

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:30.350
The dead stay at the side of the living

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:33.020
and always drag them toward the past.

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:37.400
Even Servants in the Holy Grail War
are no doubt still part of the dead.

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:40.400
Holy Grail War...

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:42.440
Oh, you are quite an avid student!

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:44.030
I don't know what he saw
during the Holy Grail War.

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:43.400
Shut up!

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:45.360
If you're done with your affairs,
hurry up and go back!

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:48.160
However, at the rate he's going,
he will become roped into more trouble.

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:48.160
In the first place, your actions
were excessive back in Adra, too!

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:53.290
He needs you, missie.

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:56.920
Well now, stay healthy!

00:21:58.460 --> 00:21:59.210
Gray!

00:21:59.210 --> 00:21:59.920
Yes!

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:02.170
We're going back to London, too!

00:22:02.510 --> 00:22:04.340
Yes! Be there right away!

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:09.930
EPISODE 5: The Lance that Shines
to the End of the World and the Fairy Eyes
